; SLICE v0.1 (sl-0098/sl-0100): THE WORLD IS THE TEST. The b77 dusk
; overworld with the content pack's territories + placements live as
; leash-gated sites (docs/23 S0 plumbing v1) — the world persists and
; refills, no run framing. Spawn = the harbor capital.
; sl-0115: the twelve authored rifts carry biomes [T] (0 nebula /
; 1 void / 2 comet, cycled) and AMBIENT rifts roll here — rifts
; spawn on land, anywhere, anytime (deck tap shk3spwn).
; sl-0198: AMBIENT forage nodes roll here too — live nodes surface
; on real forage props (the ~1.9k-cell pool is candidacy, never
; simultaneity; cap [T] world-wide), shimmer-marked, F-gathered.
; The 12 old forage POI markers are ordinary pool members now.

